WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.084 --> 00:00:03.962
I've been dreaming of doing a trip
through South America for years...

00:00:04.171 --> 00:00:07.216
We're here with world-famous actor,
Ewan McGregor.

00:00:07.299 --> 00:00:08.383
but life got in the way.

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:12.221
And now I've decided to do the trip
with my best friend Charley Boorman.

00:00:12.596 --> 00:00:14.848
You've got to look after
the relationships in your life,

00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:16.308
and if you don't, you're just...

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:18.268
you're losing something
that's very important.

00:00:18.727 --> 00:00:20.437
We'll ride 13,000 miles,

00:00:20.938 --> 00:00:22.564
from the southern tip of Argentina...

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:24.274
all the way to Los Angeles.

00:00:24.608 --> 00:00:25.943
150 miles every day,

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.986
it's... a long way to go.

00:00:28.362 --> 00:00:30.113
And if that wasn't
enough of a challenge,

00:00:30.197 --> 00:00:33.033
we wanted to see if we could
do it on electric motorcycles.

00:00:33.659 --> 00:00:35.035
I think it's the future, electric.

00:00:35.202 --> 00:00:37.621
You'll be the first people
to go this distance,

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:38.497
charging as you go.

00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:40.332
Oh, my god,
it's so great, isn't it?

00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:42.209
-Nope.
-Uh-oh.

00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:43.418
The power's just gone.

00:00:47.631 --> 00:00:49.091
Ah, this is us on
the road, Charley.

00:00:49.174 --> 00:00:50.425
This is us on the way, man.

00:00:51.093 --> 00:00:52.469
I'm gonna get
attacked by this dog.

00:00:54.555 --> 00:00:56.807
We'll ride through the
brutal Patagonian winter...

00:00:56.974 --> 00:00:57.891
Look at that snow.

00:00:57.975 --> 00:00:59.226
It's amazing how cold it is.

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:01.895
...we're gonna climb to the extreme
heights of the Andes

00:01:01.979 --> 00:01:04.439
and experience the real
risks of high altitude...

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:06.066
I can't breathe.

00:01:06.149 --> 00:01:07.568
I'm definitely getting sick, Charley.

00:01:07.818 --> 00:01:10.863
...before witnessing the endangered
jungles of Central America.

00:01:10.946 --> 00:01:13.115
You think about all of the
things that might go wrong.

00:01:13.448 --> 00:01:14.283
I think we're lost.

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:15.909
Is this a road?

00:01:15.993 --> 00:01:18.495
Roads might be a little--
Wow, whoa, I'm falling off.

00:01:20.539 --> 00:01:21.373
In the middle of the night,

00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:23.208
things just go around
your brain, don't they?

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:24.960
I have real fear.

00:01:25.043 --> 00:01:26.461
I don't want anyone to get hurt.

00:01:26.545 --> 00:01:27.379
They just roll around.

00:01:27.504 --> 00:01:28.422
I'm not gonna make it.

00:01:28.589 --> 00:01:30.716
Towing somebody on
a bike is dangerous.

00:01:30.883 --> 00:01:32.009
What if the bikes don't work?

00:01:32.176 --> 00:01:33.468
What if we can't charge the bikes?

00:01:33.844 --> 00:01:35.012
What if it snows tomorrow?

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:41.810
I really enjoy the
unknown of a town,

00:01:41.894 --> 00:01:43.604
just coming across the
people we come across.

00:01:43.687 --> 00:01:44.271
Buenos días.

00:01:44.354 --> 00:01:45.355
Amazing, the people.

00:01:46.481 --> 00:01:47.774
Learning about the cultures,

00:01:47.858 --> 00:01:49.985
and seeing how people
keep their traditions alive,

00:01:50.068 --> 00:01:52.821
puts you in touch with
yourself and the world in a way.

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:55.616
I'm an actor.

00:01:55.699 --> 00:01:56.992
What films have you made?

00:01:57.159 --> 00:01:58.952
Did anybody see...

00:01:59.036 --> 00:01:59.912
Star Wars?

00:02:00.579 --> 00:02:01.413
No.

00:02:01.496 --> 00:02:02.331
Don't think so.

00:02:02.414 --> 00:02:03.874
None of these kids have
seen anything I've done.

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:10.839
Long Way Up,

00:02:11.006 --> 00:02:13.217
two guys lost
in South America.

